            <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="font:600 15px -apple-system;margin:0 0 6px">Promptr Studio Pro 5.77</h2>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>Removed generations stay removed.</b> A card removed from the gallery no longer reappears after the next generation. Removals are recorded next to the project manifest, so a second app or teammate working in the same project folder can no longer bring them back.</li>
<li><b>Current GPT Image prices.</b> The quoted price now includes the prompt text tokens OpenAI bills, so estimate and charge match the real cost. Prices come from the catalog, no further update is needed.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
